    "detailed_description": "Throwback shooter where gibing is required, and being near death is mandatory.<br>Gibs give you ammo, and you can only heal when near death.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178740/extras/56bd30d34aaf70991aa712088d682c26.poster.avif?t=1742231791\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178740/extras/56bd30d34aaf70991aa712088d682c26.webm?t=1742231791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178740/extras/56bd30d34aaf70991aa712088d682c26.mp4?t=1742231791\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>The game will include 4 episodes, containing many maps.<br>Like an adrenaline shot, these maps are made to be cleared in one go, as brutally as possible.<br><br>Use your lead spitting arsenal to fend of waves of projectile blasting enemies, to survive in these<br>old school bullet hell gauntlets.<br><br>Sporting a hardcore industrial electronic soundtrack to get your adrenaline pumping, the bass will keep pumping<br>while you've still got blood in your veins (or health in your bar).<br><br>Inspired by the likes of Serious Sam and Duke Nukem 3D, this game is loyal to its roots, straight to the point, gory and action packed.<br><br>A short experience dense with oddities, bizarre environments and a lot of abominable sights.<br><br>This game includes auto-saves, and general settings customization including:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Sound Mixer<br></li><li> Resolution<br></li><li> Window Type<br></li><li> V-Sync</li></ul><br>Go for broke, or don't go at all.<br><br>The enemies are parasites, it's you against them.<br>Never yield.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178740/extras/01335d8d9f667401726e7755051e0c87.avif?t=1742231791\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "Throwback shooter where gibing is required, and being near death is mandatory.<br>Gibs give you ammo, and you can only heal when near death.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178740/extras/56bd30d34aaf70991aa712088d682c26.poster.avif?t=1742231791\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178740/extras/56bd30d34aaf70991aa712088d682c26.webm?t=1742231791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178740/extras/56bd30d34aaf70991aa712088d682c26.mp4?t=1742231791\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>The game will include 4 episodes, containing many maps.<br>Like an adrenaline shot, these maps are made to be cleared in one go, as brutally as possible.<br><br>Use your lead spitting arsenal to fend of waves of projectile blasting enemies, to survive in these<br>old school bullet hell gauntlets.<br><br>Sporting a hardcore industrial electronic soundtrack to get your adrenaline pumping, the bass will keep pumping<br>while you've still got blood in your veins (or health in your bar).<br><br>Inspired by the likes of Serious Sam and Duke Nukem 3D, this game is loyal to its roots, straight to the point, gory and action packed.<br><br>A short experience dense with oddities, bizarre environments and a lot of abominable sights.<br><br>This game includes auto-saves, and general settings customization including:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Sound Mixer<br></li><li> Resolution<br></li><li> Window Type<br></li><li> V-Sync</li></ul><br>Go for broke, or don't go at all.<br><br>The enemies are parasites, it's you against them.<br>Never yield.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2178740/extras/01335d8d9f667401726e7755051e0c87.avif?t=1742231791\" /></div>",
